WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
Welcome to Renew. Renew is about how the environment impacts all of us. We are hoping

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.160
to teach you some new things to think about and some activities you could do on your own,

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.000
with friends or family or even with a counselor in the future if you want. We hope after doing

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.280
Renew you feel smarter or better or both. Thank you in advance for your time and now it's

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.080
on with the show.

